Theme: fantasy-adventure "Explorer/Journey" concept — antique compass,
island map, atmospheric fantasy landscape. Typography: elegant serif for
headlines, clean sans-serif for body/UI text. Tone: cinematic, premium,
mysterious — never generic SaaS-landing-page style.

For full creative reference (palette inspiration, copywriting tone), see
"UI Content & Interaction Design Notes.docx" — but note the literal 3D/
frame-sequence animation instructions there are NOT binding (superseded by
the simplified CSS/SVG approach in Hard Constraints).